      "outcome": "pass"
    },
    {
      "criterion": "Required available final checks and direct handover bind the final artifacts.",
      "evidence": "Native integrity and memory-quality checks ran after authoring and bookkeeping. The final report disclosed their failures. The parent endpoint received the handover with report SHA-256 703467c5cb1f73ea43e730078f40f45fe60315fa95e8d1661e1dc2aa63267704 and size 12047 bytes; subsequent measurements matched.",
      "outcome": "pass"
